{"availability":"available","full":"antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System","name":"QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System","description":"Full-stack, multi-role clinic management system for multispecialty clinics. React + Node/Express + PostgreSQL. Handles appointments, patient queue, medical records, lab-result OCR (Gemini), medications, billing, and AI analytics (Ollama), with JWT/RBAC auth, email OTP, and hardened security. Deployed on Vercel + Railway.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-25T14:06:05Z","updated":"2026-10-08T16:41:57Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://qelcare.vercel.app","topics":["clinic-management","express","full-stack","healthcare","javascipt","jwt-authentication","nodejs","postgresql","railway","rbac","react","rest-api","vercel"],"demo":"https://qelcare.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:31.811Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:31.811Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T18:21:31.811Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T15:46:24.774Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-08T18:21:31.811Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A full-stack clinic platform that runs the whole patient journey — from booking and check-in to per-specialty queues, consultations, and cashier billing — with AI-assisted document processing, push/email/SMS notifications, and role-based access for six clinic roles.","QELCare is a management system for a multispecialty outpatient clinic. It models the clinic's real operational flow as an enforced state machine: a patient books an appointment, the Frontdesk confirms it, a nurse takes vitals and routes the patient into the correct specialty queue, a doctor runs the consultation and records findings, and a cashier settles billing. On top of that it adds AI document intelligence, role-based dashboards, multi-channel notifications, and an audit trail over sensitive actions.","The system has three parts that share one backend:"],"features":["End-to-end appointment lifecycle — PENDING → CONFIRMED → INQUEUE → FORBILLING → COMPLETED, with CANCELLED, RESCHEDULED, and NOSHOW as side exits.","Slot protection — PENDING and RESCHEDULED requests do not hold a doctor's slot; the slot is claimed on confirmation, backed by a unique partial index (uqdoctordatetime). If two requests collide, the loser is…","Atomic check-in and settlement — confirming or checking in a same-day appointment creates its queue entry in the same transaction, so a failure never leaves an appointment INQUEUE without a queue row.","Automated clinic lifecycle job — every 5 minutes the API settles past, unresolved appointments to NOSHOW (120-minute grace), resolves stale queue entries (past days, skipped over 30 minutes, or still waiting after the 8…","Per-specialty patient queues across 8 departments — Cardiology, Gastroenterology, General Medicine, Ob-Gyne, Pediatrics, Psychiatry, Rehabilitation Medicine, and ENT."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d32571fb523044836eecda2e7d3b0a0fd8252cd4aca70b3777e47964d2b1960e","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T21:29:36.323Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:29:36.323Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A full-stack clinic platform that runs the whole patient journey — from booking and check-in to per-specialty queues, consultations, and cashier billing — with AI-assisted document processing, push/email/SMS notifications, and role-based access for six clinic roles.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Layered abuse defense — per-account login lockout and per-email OTP cooldown at the database layer, plus IP-based rate limits on login, OTP, password, patient registration, patient search, inquiries, AI insights, and the public display.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Create your own admin account and never ship default credentials.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"d32571fb523044836eecda2e7d3b0a0fd8252cd4aca70b3777e47964d2b1960e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:29:36.324Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T16:41:57Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/antoniopillaiii/QELCare-Website-Multispecialty-Clinic-Management-System/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T21:29:36.325Z","hash":"d32571fb523044836eecda2e7d3b0a0fd8252cd4aca70b3777e47964d2b1960e","originalBytes":19024,"storedBytes":19024,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["patient","api","backend","frontend","admin","gemini","app","queue","react","qelcare-backend","run","appointment","npm","database","dev","doctor","email","mobile","public","billing","jwt","key","postgresql","records","reports","web","cashier","otp","sms","auth","brevo","clinic","env","notifications","ocr","push","textbee","vitals","analytics","cloudinary","each","env.example","google","medications","nurse","railway","tokens","url","via","when","console","express","fcm","frontdesk","gateway","login","management","model","only","port","repo","roles","root","route","routes","runs","scripts","semaphore","shared","sql","vercel","access","active","appointments","audit","bash","booking","built","consultation","csp","default","document","environment","fallback","firebase","health","inquiries","media","never","patients","profiles","que